{"steam_appid":4042160,"steam_name":"Static Dread: The Submarine","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4042160/882436482/c2d5904144ba2fd0831d06c8c0b7eb525c7e747a/1786039785/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786719057","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257393171/469b4ef773ca9a9ebda47f1d2b97387dfeb9ea8b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786719057","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/fb58fe822c3b35f1fb9196c12c12f6bbdf330c51/ss_fb58fe822c3b35f1fb9196c12c12f6bbdf330c51.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719640","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/d878f783ddb79fba022480847f7aef6ee0f677a4/ss_d878f783ddb79fba022480847f7aef6ee0f677a4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719640","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/2e213b9a34292dd544ce25d99a7a835b3611ffb0/ss_2e213b9a34292dd544ce25d99a7a835b3611ffb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719640","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/f365a4ce5c5cb14a09d779910b54f017928fc606/ss_f365a4ce5c5cb14a09d779910b54f017928fc606.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719640","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/80578ba493a2f6fad6b32c0c3cf4d0e256015085/ss_80578ba493a2f6fad6b32c0c3cf4d0e256015085.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786719640"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A psychological horror set in a Lovecraftian setting, blending with the cold reality of a military submarine trapped in the depths of the North Atlantic. This story follows ordinary people pushed to the brink of madness as they encounter the unthinkable horrors beneath the waves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOVECRAFTIAN HORROR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/a6226c78d31399364a69faf2b7dad980.poster.avif?t=1786719640\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/a6226c78d31399364a69faf2b7dad980.webm?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/a6226c78d31399364a69faf2b7dad980.mp4?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient forces have awakened beneath the ocean, and all contact with the surface is lost. Seek answers at the heart of an apocalypse aboard a nuclear submarine. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HARD CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/50d02323454489477b495db35afcf282.poster.avif?t=1786719640\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/50d02323454489477b495db35afcf282.webm?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/50d02323454489477b495db35afcf282.mp4?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew member is more than just an asset. They are human beings, haunted by their own fears and suffering. You have to make hard choice – complete the mission or preserve your humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARE IN CHARGE NOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/efe9ac851d4d3cbd1b7dae3a4f4d7745.poster.avif?t=1786719640\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/efe9ac851d4d3cbd1b7dae3a4f4d7745.webm?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/efe9ac851d4d3cbd1b7dae3a4f4d7745.mp4?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the captain’s right hand. Assign tasks, maintain discipline, and don’t let madness overcome your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK INTO THE ABYSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/f0e9d602e906197b906912be46bd6bcc.poster.avif?t=1786719640\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/f0e9d602e906197b906912be46bd6bcc.webm?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4042160/extras/f0e9d602e906197b906912be46bd6bcc.mp4?t=1786719640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan the depths with sonar. But remember, not everything in the ocean follows military protocol… Is it another submarine, or something alive?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or analogue<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 1050 or analogue<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 or analogue<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 1070 Ti or analogue<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["solarsuit.games"],"publishers":["Polden Publishing"],"release_date":"Aug 14, 2026"}